Notes
- All names, phone numbers, UPI IDs, account numbers and canary secrets in the data
  are synthetic. None refer to real people or accounts.
- The attack messages are for evaluating defenses. Do not send them to real
  services or use them against systems you do not own.
- Recorded model outputs come from Qwen3 models (Apache-2.0). Prompt Guard 2 scores
  were produced with Meta's Llama Prompt Guard 2 under the Llama license; its
